        "answer": {
          "short": "$1088.2\\text{ cm}^3$",
          "worked": "All ticked lengths are $4\\text{ cm}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}d&=4+4+4=12\\text{ cm}\\\\r&=6\\text{ cm}\\\\V_1&=4\\times4\\times15\\\\V_1&=240\\text{ cm}^3\\\\V_2&=\\frac{\\pi\\times6^2}{2}\\times15\\\\V_2&=270\\pi\\text{ cm}^3\\\\V&=240+270\\pi\\\\V&\\approx1088.2\\text{ cm}^3\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
