          "short": "$1375.5\\text{ cm}^3$",
          "worked": "The quadrant radius gives a shared height of $12\\text{ cm}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}A_1&=\\frac{15\\times12}{2}=90\\text{ cm}^2\\\\A_2&=6\\times12=72\\text{ cm}^2\\\\A_3&=\\frac{\\pi\\times12^2}{4}=36\\pi\\text{ cm}^2\\\\V&=(90+72+36\\pi)\\times5\\\\V&=810+180\\pi\\\\V&\\approx1375.5\\text{ cm}^3\\end{align*}$$",
